<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar experts to review aid for syrup.</title>
<headline>EU sugar experts to review aid for syrup.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will review on Wednesday a draft regulation on aid to producers of sugar syrup in French overseas territories, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;This is a longstanding measure which cannot be completed until the French government provides accurate figures and there will be no immediate decision,&quot; the official said. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
